title: >
  Empirical Degradation-Aware Sizing of Hybrid Photovoltaic--Battery--Supercapacitor Energy Storage Systems for Electric Vehicle Charging Stations: Cycle-Life Calibration, Real-World Demand Validation, and Geographic Tariff Analysis

